---
// The jury room: lamp, chairs, dealt ballots, and how the case works.

---
<section class="slide bg-black s-jury" id="the-jury" data-ink="#FFF" data-label="The jury" data-fx="iris" data-fxc="#E5481E">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="tablebox">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 386" class="jtable" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    </div>
    <ol class="how">
      <li class="a" style="--d:4.3s"><b>The case</b><span>Is Rayan Alyasi just a student, or already an engineer?</span></li>
      <li class="a" style="--d:4.55s"><b>The jury</b><span>Eleven jurors voted “just a student” in ten seconds, without seeing any evidence.</span></li>
      <li class="a" style="--d:4.8s"><b>You, Juror 8</b><span>Like Henry Fonda in the film, you ask to see the evidence. Eight exhibits follow. Watch the counter as each one changes votes.</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
